The Core Structure of this Cucumber Framework is

Src
    pages --> All the page elements and page methods will be stored here
        pagefile.js
    features --> All the business scenarios will be described using gherkin language will be stored here
        featurefile.feature
    stepdefinitions --> All the step definitions for the page will be stored here
        stepfile.step.js
    support ---> Before the Execution and After the Execution will be configured here
        hooks.js